  "title": "Air Fryer Pumpkin Spice Donut Holes",
  "description": "These pumpkin spice donut holes are cooked in the air fryer and are reminiscent of mini muffins. Roll them in a sugar mixture with pumpkin spice and cinnamon.",
  "authors": [
    "Yoly"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-11-10T03:22:05-05:00",
